        "original_id": "a80b0549-79da-5806-8e27-c910a17fd1af",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Operation Pacific\n- People: Ward Bond, John Wayne, Patricia Neal, Philip Carey, George Waggner\n- Topics: World War II submarine films, American film and television acting\n\nFacts:\n- Operation Pacific is a 1951 World War II submarine film.\n- Operation Pacific stars John Wayne and Patricia Neal.\n- Operation Pacific features Ward Bond and Philip Carey.\n- George Waggner directed Operation Pacific.\n- Wardell Edwin Bond was known as Ward Bond.\n- Ward Bond was born on April 9, 1903, and died on November 5, 1960.\n- Ward Bond was an American film character actor.\n- Ward Bond appeared in more than two hundred films.\n- Ward Bond's rugged appearance and easygoing charm were featured in the NBC television series Wagon Train from 1957 to 1960.",
